WEBVTT

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.430
There's also a push for legislative action

00:11:00.463 --> 00:11:03.830
to invest in the fantastic
new opportunities

00:11:03.863 --> 00:11:07.130
in clean energy,
electric vehicles and more.

00:11:07.163 --> 00:11:11.863
Yet you and I have both seen
the difficulties

00:11:11.863 --> 00:11:14.097
of this approach in the past.

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:17.830
How can we use all of this activity

00:11:17.863 --> 00:11:20.663
to well and truly convince the world

00:11:20.697 --> 00:11:25.897
that America is genuinely back
to being part of the solution?

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:27.263
I know we are.

00:11:27.297 --> 00:11:29.063
You know we are,

00:11:29.063 --> 00:11:32.797
but we've got to really restore
that confidence.